---
// TikTok 200k+ Files Massive MonoRepo Architecture & Governance Diagram Component
---

<figure class="tiktok-mono-diagram" aria-labelledby="tiktok-mono-caption">
  <svg
    class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="tiktok-mono-title tiktok-mono-desc"
  >
    <title id="tiktok-mono-title">
      TikTok 20 萬檔案超大型前端 MonoRepo 治理架構
    </title>
    <desc id="tiktok-mono-desc">
      展示超大型前端 MonoRepo
      的四大核心治理防線：領域套件邊界隔離、依賴圖譜影響範圍分析、雲端增量雜湊快取與分散式任務排程
      (DTE)，以及微前端執行環境沙盒隔離。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="ttm-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="ttm-arrow-pink"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"
          class="tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow-head--pink"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Stage 1: Domain Package Boundary -->
    <g
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__card tiktok-mono-diagram__card--pink"
      transform="translate(30, 40)"
    >
      <rect width="200" height="160" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__badge tiktok-mono-diagram__badge--pink"
        x="16"
        y="24">01. BOUNDARY DEFENSE</text
      >
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__title tiktok-mono-diagram__title--pink"
        x="16"
        y="52">領域套件邊界隔離</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="76"
        >• 嚴格規範 Workspace 依賴</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="96"
        >• 禁止跨領域私有深層 import</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="116"
        >• ESLint 規則與 AST 靜態攔截</text
      >
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__tag tiktok-mono-diagram__tag--pink"
        x="16"
        y="142">Package Boundary Linting</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="tiktok-mono-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 240)">
      <rect width="200" height="160" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24">REPO SCALE</text>
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__title" x="16" y="52"
        >200,000+ 檔案巨庫</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="76"
        >• 數千名工程師每日提交</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="96"
        >• 數百個獨立業務子 App</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="116"
        >• Git 稀疏檢出 (Sparse Checkout)</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__tag" x="16" y="142"
        >Eden / Turbo Monorepo</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrows from Stage 1 to Graph Engine -->
    <path
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 230 120 H 285"
      marker-end="url(#ttm-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 230 320 H 285"
      marker-end="url(#ttm-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 2: Dependency Graph & Change Impact Analysis -->
    <g
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__card tiktok-mono-diagram__card--teal"
      transform="translate(290, 100)"
    >
      <rect width="200" height="220" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__badge tiktok-mono-diagram__badge--teal"
        x="16"
        y="24">02. GRAPH ANALYSIS</text
      >
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__title tiktok-mono-diagram__title--teal"
        x="16"
        y="52">依賴圖譜與影響分析</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• Git Diff 追蹤受影響檔案</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="98"
        >• Affected Graph 精準定位</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="118"
        >• 僅測試與建置受變更節點</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="138"
        >• 阻斷無效的全庫重編譯</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="16" y="158"
        >• 減少 80% CI 運算量</text
      >
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__tag tiktok-mono-diagram__tag--teal"
        x="16"
        y="196">Affected Scope Detection</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrows from Stage 2 to Cloud Cache & DTE -->
    <path
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow--pink"
      d="M 490 160 H 540"
      marker-end="url(#ttm-arrow-pink)"></path>
    <path
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow--pink"
      d="M 490 260 H 540"
      marker-end="url(#ttm-arrow-pink)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 3: Remote Cloud Cache & DTE Scheduler -->
    <g class="tiktok-mono-diagram__card" transform="translate(545, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="160" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__badge" x="14" y="24"
        >03. CLOUD CACHE</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__title" x="14" y="50">雲端增量快取</text>
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="74"
        >• 內容雜湊 (Content Hash)</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="94"
        >• 輸入未變則秒級命中重用</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="114"
        >• 全域跨開發者/CI 快取共享</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__tag" x="14" y="142"
        >Zero-Compute Replay</text
      >
    </g>

    <g
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__card tiktok-mono-diagram__card--pink"
      transform="translate(545, 240)"
    >
      <rect width="200" height="160" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__badge tiktok-mono-diagram__badge--pink"
        x="14"
        y="24">04. PARALLEL DTE</text
      >
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__title tiktok-mono-diagram__title--pink"
        x="14"
        y="50">分散式任務排程 (DTE)</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="74"
        >• 任務圖動態切片分配</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="94"
        >• 數十台 CI Agent 負載均衡</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="114"
        >• CI 耗時從 60m 縮短至 5m</text
      >
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__tag tiktok-mono-diagram__tag--pink"
        x="14"
        y="142">Distributed Task Execution</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrows from Stage 3 to Microfrontend Deployment -->
    <path
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 745 120 H 775"
      marker-end="url(#ttm-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow--pink"
      d="M 745 320 H 775"
      marker-end="url(#ttm-arrow-pink)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 4: Microfrontend Runtime Isolation -->
    <g
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram__card tiktok-mono-diagram__card--teal"
      transform="translate(780, 110)"
    >
      <rect width="150" height="200" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__badge tiktok-mono-diagram__badge--teal"
        x="14"
        y="24">RUNTIME</text
      >
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__title tiktok-mono-diagram__title--teal"
        x="14"
        y="52">微前端沙盒隔離</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="78">• Garfish 框架</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="100"
        >• JS 沙盒與 CSS 隔離</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="122"
        >• 模組聯邦 (Module Fed)</text
      >
      <text class="tiktok-mono-diagram__desc" x="14" y="144"
        >• 獨立上線不撞車</text
      >
      <text
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram__tag tiktok-mono-diagram__tag--teal"
        x="14"
        y="180">獨立解耦發布</text
      >
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Version -->
  <div class="tiktok-mono-diagram__mobile">
    <div
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card--pink"
    >
      <span
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge--pink"
        >01. 邊界防禦</span
      >
      <h4>領域模組邊界隔離 (Boundary Defense)</h4>
      <p>
        規範 Workspace 邊界，透過 ESLint 與 AST 靜態攔截跨領域非法 private
        import，防止巨庫架構腐化。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-arrow">↓ 變更影響範圍識別</div>

    <div
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card--teal"
    >
      <span
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge--teal"
        >02. 依賴圖譜分析</span
      >
      <h4>Affected Graph 影響分析</h4>
      <p>
        精準比對 Git Diff，只對真正受影響的下游套件執行建置與測試，剔除 80%
        無效運算負擔。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-arrow">↓ 雲端快取與分散式排程</div>

    <div
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card--pink"
    >
      <span
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge--pink"
        >03. 增量快取與 DTE 排程</span
      >
      <h4>Content Hash 雲端快取與分散式執行</h4>
      <p>
        已建置產物全域共享秒級命中，未命中任務動態派發給數十台 CI Agent
        平行執行，流水線時間由 60 分鐘壓縮至 5 分鐘。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-arrow">↓ 獨立運行時沙盒</div>

    <div
      class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card--teal"
    >
      <span
        class="tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge--teal"
        >04. 運行時沙盒</span
      >
      <h4>微前端執行環境隔離 (Garfish / 沙盒)</h4>
      <p>
        各業務子應用獨立部署、動態載入，JS 與 CSS
        嚴密隔離，保障巨型應用全域穩定。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="tiktok-mono-caption">
    圖 1：TikTok 20 萬檔案超大型前端 MonoRepo
    治理架構：邊界防禦、依賴影響分析、雲端快取與微前端運行隔離。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .tiktok-mono-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card, #f8fafc);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram {
    background: #0f111a;
    border-color: #1e2438;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Styles */
  .tiktok-mono-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--color-bg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--color-border, #cbd5e1);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #1a1e2e;
    stroke: #2e384d;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__card--pink rect {
    fill: #fdf2f8;
    stroke: #ec4899;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__card--pink rect {
    fill: #4c0519;
    stroke: #f43f5e;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__card--teal rect {
    fill: #f0fdfa;
    stroke: #0d9488;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__card--teal rect {
    fill: #042f2e;
    stroke: #14b8a6;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    fill: #64748b;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__badge--pink {
    fill: #db2777;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__badge--pink {
    fill: #f472b6;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__badge--teal {
    fill: #0d9488;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__badge--teal {
    fill: #2dd4bf;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #0f172a;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__title--pink {
    fill: #be185d;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__title--pink {
    fill: #fda4af;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__title--teal {
    fill: #0f766e;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__title--teal {
    fill: #5eead4;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: #475569;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__desc {
    fill: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__tag {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: #64748b;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__tag {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__tag--pink {
    fill: #db2777;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__tag--pink {
    fill: #f472b6;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__tag--teal {
    fill: #0d9488;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__tag--teal {
    fill: #2dd4bf;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #94a3b8;
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow {
    stroke: #475569;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow--pink {
    stroke: #ec4899;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow--pink {
    stroke: #f43f5e;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #475569;
  }

  .tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow-head--pink {
    fill: #ec4899;
  }

  :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram__arrow-head--pink {
    fill: #f43f5e;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Responsive for mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .tiktok-mono-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--color-bg-surface, #ffffff);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card {
      background: #1a1e2e;
      border-color: #2e384d;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card--pink {
      border-left: 4px solid #ec4899;
      background: #fdf2f8;
    }

    :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card--pink {
      background: #4c0519;
      border-color: #f43f5e;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card--teal {
      border-left: 4px solid #0d9488;
      background: #f0fdfa;
    }

    :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card--teal {
      background: #042f2e;
      border-color: #14b8a6;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #64748b;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge--pink {
      color: #ec4899;
    }

    :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge--pink {
      color: #f472b6;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge--teal {
      color: #0d9488;
    }

    :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-badge--teal {
      color: #2dd4bf;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text-main, #0f172a);
    }

    :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card h4 {
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted, #475569);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    :global(.dark) .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-card p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .tiktok-mono-diagram-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #64748b;
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
